{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://wistprotocol.org/schemas/registry-update.schema.json",
  "title": "WIST Registry Update (WIST-4)",
  "description": "A governance act sealed as a `registry_update` Entry (WIST-3 §3.3) under the Log key. `action` selects the `details` contract of WIST-4 §5.1; the semantic checks that section names — the grace period, the parameter bounds that depend on other values, the Delta a withdrawal names, the octets a suffix_list_update pins — are outside the schema.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["update", "sig"],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "update": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["wist_version", "action", "subject", "effective_at", "details"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "wist_version": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)$(?![\\s\\S])"},
        "action": {"enum": ["aggregator_key_add", "aggregator_key_remove", "parameter_change", "payload_withdrawal", "suffix_list_update"]},
        "subject": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256},
        "details": {"type": "object"},
        "effective_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-5][0-9]Z$(?![\\s\\S])",
          "description": "RFC 3339 UTC at whole-second precision with a literal trailing Z, the form WIST-3 §3.1 fixes for `sealed_at`. Every window this field takes part in is compared against an Epoch `sealed_at` — the WIST-4 §5 grace period above all — so the two are written in one form and compare without normalization. It states when the act takes effect; WIST-1 §5.2 runs the recovery window from the `sealed_at` of the Epoch sealing the Entry."
        }
      }
    },
    "sig": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["key_id", "alg", "value"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "key_id": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 64},
        "alg": {"const": "Ed25519"},
        "value": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{85}[AQgw]$(?![\\s\\S])"}
      }
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "comment": "WIST-3 §3.4, WIST-4 §5.1: an aggregator_key_add registers a raw Ed25519 public key under a key_id, and `subject` is that key_id.",
      "if": {"properties": {"update": {"properties": {"action": {"const": "aggregator_key_add"}}}}},
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "update": {
            "properties": {
              "subject": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64},
              "details": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["key_id", "alg", "public_key"],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "key_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64},
                  "alg": {"const": "Ed25519"},
                  "public_key": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{42}[AEIMQUYcgkosw048]$(?![\\s\\S])"}
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "WIST-3 §3.4, WIST-4 §5.1: an aggregator_key_remove retires the key_id it names, and `subject` is that key_id.",
      "if": {"properties": {"update": {"properties": {"action": {"const": "aggregator_key_remove"}}}}},
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "update": {
            "properties": {
              "subject": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64},
              "details": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["key_id"],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "key_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64}
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "WIST-4 §5: `parameter` is an Identifier from the Parameter Registry, `subject` repeats it, and `value` is an integer in that parameter's unit inside the wire range; the fixed bounds the Registry publishes are enforced per identifier below, and the bounds that depend on another parameter's value are replay checks (WIST4-E03).",
      "if": {"properties": {"update": {"properties": {"action": {"const": "parameter_change"}}}}},
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "update": {
            "properties": {
              "subject": {"enum": [
                "epoch_cadence_seconds", "epoch_cap_bytes",
                "checkpoint_witness_quorum",
                "extract_cap_bytes", "links_cap_bytes", "link_url_cap_bytes",
                "summary_cap_bytes", "url_cap_bytes", "payload_window_days",
                "mirror_retention_days", "record_seal_epochs",
                "domain_epoch_entries_max", "labeler_epoch_entries_max", "max_inclusion_epochs",
                "ingest_budget_bytes_day", "feed_window", "clock_skew_seconds",
                "keyset_cache_ttl_seconds", "baseline_poll_seconds", "quota_base",
                "recovery_window_days", "param_grace_days",
                "declaration_activation_epochs"
              ]},
              "details": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["parameter", "value"],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "parameter": {"enum": [
                    "epoch_cadence_seconds", "epoch_cap_bytes",
                    "checkpoint_witness_quorum",
                    "extract_cap_bytes", "links_cap_bytes", "link_url_cap_bytes",
                    "summary_cap_bytes", "url_cap_bytes", "payload_window_days",
                    "mirror_retention_days", "record_seal_epochs",
                    "domain_epoch_entries_max", "labeler_epoch_entries_max", "max_inclusion_epochs",
                    "ingest_budget_bytes_day", "feed_window", "clock_skew_seconds",
                    "keyset_cache_ttl_seconds", "baseline_poll_seconds", "quota_base",
                    "recovery_window_days", "param_grace_days",
                    "declaration_activation_epochs"
                  ]},
                  "value": {"type": "integer", "minimum": -9007199254740991, "maximum": 9007199254740991, "description": "Every numeric constant in this suite is an integer in the unit WIST-4 §5 states for it, and this is the one field through which any of them is ever rewritten; the range is WIST-1 §4's JCS integer domain."}
                },
                "allOf": [
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "epoch_cadence_seconds"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1, "maximum": 86400}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "epoch_cap_bytes"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 65537}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "checkpoint_witness_quorum"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 0}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "extract_cap_bytes"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 2}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "links_cap_bytes"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 21}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "link_url_cap_bytes"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 14}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "summary_cap_bytes"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 12}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "url_cap_bytes"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 14}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "feed_window"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "recovery_window_days"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "param_grace_days"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "payload_window_days"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 30}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "mirror_retention_days"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 30}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "record_seal_epochs"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "domain_epoch_entries_max"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "labeler_epoch_entries_max"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "max_inclusion_epochs"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "ingest_budget_bytes_day"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1048576}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "quota_base"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 1}}}},
                  {"if": {"properties": {"parameter": {"const": "declaration_activation_epochs"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"value": {"minimum": 0}}}}
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "WIST-3 §6.2, WIST-4 §5.1: a payload_withdrawal names the Delta whose Payload leaves distribution, the legal ground and the jurisdiction, and `subject` is the Publisher's Canonical Host. Which Delta it may name is a replay check (WIST4-E04).",
      "if": {"properties": {"update": {"properties": {"action": {"const": "payload_withdrawal"}}}}},
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "update": {
            "properties": {
              "subject": {"type": "string", "format": "wist-canonical-host", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 253, "pattern": "^[a-z0-9-]{1,63}(\\.[a-z0-9-]{1,63})*$(?![\\s\\S])", "description": "Must equal its own Canonical Host under WIST-1 sections 2 and 5.1, including Unicode 16.0 UTS #46 A-label validation; the pattern alone is insufficient."},
              "details": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["delta_id", "legal_basis", "jurisdiction"],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "delta_id": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$(?![\\s\\S])"},
                  "legal_basis": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 1024},
                  "jurisdiction": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 128}
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "WIST-4 §3.1, §5.1: a suffix_list_update pins a Public Suffix List snapshot by the SHA-256 of its octets and their count; `subject` is that identifier and `details.sha256` repeats it. Whether the identified file exists, hashes as named and has `bytes` octets is a replay check (WIST4-E04, WIST3-E01/E03).",
      "if": {"properties": {"update": {"properties": {"action": {"const": "suffix_list_update"}}}}},
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "update": {
            "properties": {
              "subject": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$(?![\\s\\S])"},
              "details": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["sha256", "bytes"],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "sha256": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$(?![\\s\\S])"},
                  "bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 9007199254740991}
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
